- IapStore.buyConsumable; IapConfig.boostEnabled/boostProducts;
  IapRepository: boost-intent, verify(intentId), boost-redeem,
  boost-credits; AppError.data (sold_out nextFreeAt, slotId, max...).
- BoostController: intent -> account token -> consumable -> verify;
  200 dan keyin (active / credited / revoked) consumable HAR DOIM
  yopiladi; 400/422 (days_mismatch...) yakuniy — yopiladi; 403
  intent_forbidden, 409, 429, 503, tarmoq — ochiq qoladi. Ilova
  ochilganda ochiq tranzaksiya intentId siz -> kredit. Premium oqimi
  ko'tarish mahsulotlariga tegmaydi.
- UI (faqat iPhone + boostEnabled): o'z post/Reels'ida "Ko'tarish"
  (post ekrani tugmasi, Reels "•••" menyusi), varaq: 1/3/6 kun,
  App Store narxi, band / tez orada / allaqachon ko'tarilgan qatori,
  natija (faol + tugash vaqti / kredit). "Ko'tarish kreditlari" ekrani
  (Sozlamalar → Hisob, kredit bo'lsa) -> o'z postini tanlash -> redeem.
- Sinovlar: test/iap_boost_test.dart (54 ta).

